# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 217
msgid ""
"If your GPU supports video encoding, conversion will be much faster.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic detection is usually the best choice, but you can also select it manually.\n"
"\n"
"Software mode is slower but compatible with more formats.\n"
"\n"
"If the GPU isn’t supported, the system will try partial GPU processing and automatically fall back to Software mode if needed."
msgstr ""
"Hvis din GPU understøtter videoenkodning, vil konverteringen være meget hurtigere.\n"
"\n"
"Automatisk detektion er normalt det bedste valg, men du kan også vælge det manuelt.\n"
"\n"
"Softwaretilstand er langsommere, men kompatibel med flere formater.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis GPU'en ikke understøttes, vil systemet forsøge delvis GPU-behandling og automatisk falde tilbage til softwaretilstand, hvis det er nødvendigt."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 223
msgid ""
"Higher quality means a larger file.\n"
"\n"
"The default option is a good balance between image quality and file size."
msgstr ""
"Højere kvalitet betyder en større fil.\n"
"\n"
"Standardindstillingen er en god balance mellem billedkvalitet og filstørrelse."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 232
msgid ""
"H.264: An older format that works on almost all devices. It takes up more storage space but is the fastest to convert.\n"
"\n"
"H.265: A newer version of H.264. It doesn't work on older devices and compresses files more efficiently.\n"
"\n"
"VP9: Widely used by YouTube. If your computer doesn't have a compatible graphics card, the conversion can be very slow.\n"
"\n"
"AV1: The most modern format. It offers the best compression (creating smaller files), but the conversion can also be slow if the graphics card isn't compatible.\n"
"\n"
"ProRes: Professional editing codec (Apple). Preserves maximum quality for video editing workflows. CPU-only, outputs .mov format."
msgstr ""
"H.264: Et ældre format, der fungerer på næsten alle enheder. Det optager mere lagerplads, men er hurtigst at konvertere.\n"
"\n"
"H.265: En nyere version af H.264. Det fungerer ikke på ældre enheder og komprimerer filer mere effektivt.\n"
"\n"
"VP9: Bredt anvendt af YouTube. Hvis din computer ikke har et kompatibelt grafikkort, kan konverteringen være meget langsom.\n"
"\n"
"AV1: Det mest moderne format. Det tilbyder den bedste kompression (skaber mindre filer), men konverteringen kan også være langsom, hvis grafikkortet ikke er kompatibelt.\n"
"\n"
"ProRes: Professionel redigeringskodek (Apple). Bevarer maksimal kvalitet til videoredigeringsarbejdsgange. Kun CPU, output i .mov format."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 230
msgid ""
"Copy is usually best, fast and preserves full quality.\n"
"\n"
"Re-encoding slightly reduces quality but improves compatibility and can reduce file size."
msgstr ""
"Kopiering er normalt bedst, hurtig og bevarer fuld kvalitet.\n"
"\n"
"Genkodning reducerer lidt kvaliteten, men forbedrer kompatibiliteten og kan reducere filstørrelsen."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 234
msgid ""
"If subtitles are embedded, keeping them is usually best.\n"
"\n"
"Some players need an external subtitle file."
msgstr ""
"Hvis undertekster er indlejret, er det normalt bedst at beholde dem.\n"
"\n"
"Nogle afspillere har brug for en ekstern undertekstfil."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 238
msgid ""
"Copying video is extremely fast and keeps full image quality.\n"
"\n"
"Perfect for cutting or trimming videos for social media."
msgstr ""
"Kopiering af video er ekstremt hurtigt og bevarer fuld billedkvalitet.\n"
"\n"
"Perfekt til at klippe eller trimme videoer til sociale medier."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 243
msgid ""
"Slower conversion produces smaller files.\n"
"\n"
"Faster presets create larger files but convert in less time."
msgstr ""
"Langsom konvertering producerer mindre filer.\n"
"\n"
"Hurtigere forudindstillinger skaber større filer, men konverterer på kortere tid."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 247
msgid ""
"Audio format (when converting):\n"
"\n"
"• AAC: Most compatible, good quality\n"
"• Opus: Excellent quality at small sizes\n"
"• AC3 (Dolby Digital): Good for home theater"
msgstr ""
"Lydformat (ved konvertering):\n"
"\n"
"• AAC: Mest kompatibel, god kvalitet\n"
"• Opus: Fremragende kvalitet ved små størrelser\n"
"• AC3 (Dolby Digital): Godt til hjemmebiograf"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 253
msgid ""
"Output size:\n"
"\n"
"• Original: Keep the same resolution\n"
"• Standard: 4K, Full HD, HD (TVs and monitors)\n"
"• Vertical: For phones and social media\n"
"• Custom: Set your own dimensions"
msgstr ""
"Output størrelse:\n"
"\n"
"• Original: Behold den samme opløsning\n"
"• Standard: 4K, Full HD, HD (TV og skærme)\n"
"• Vertikal: Til telefoner og sociale medier\n"
"• Tilpasset: Indstil dine egne dimensioner"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 265
msgid ""
"• MP4: Most compatible\n"
"• MKV: More features\n"
"• MOV: Apple/ProRes workflows\n"
"• WebM: Web optimized (VP9/AV1)"
msgstr ""
"• MP4: Mest kompatibel  \n"
"• MKV: Flere funktioner  \n"
"• MOV: Apple/ProRes arbejdsgange  \n"
"• WebM: Weboptimeret (VP9/AV1)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 262
msgid ""
"• Move right: Brighter\n"
"• Move left: Darker\n"
"• Default: 0 (no change)"
msgstr ""
"• Flyt til højre: Lysere  \n"
"• Flyt til venstre: Mørkere  \n"
"• Standard: 0 (ingen ændring)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 265
msgid ""
"• Move right: More vivid\n"
"• Move left: More muted\n"
"• Default: 1.0 (no change)"
msgstr ""
"• Flyt til højre: Mere livlig  \n"
"• Flyt til venstre: Mere afdæmpet  \n"
"• Standard: 1.0 (ingen ændring)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 270
msgid ""
"• Positive: More red/yellow\n"
"• Negative: More blue/green\n"
"• Default: 0 (no change)"
msgstr ""
"• Positiv: Mere rød/gul  \n"
"• Negativ: Mere blå/grøn  \n"
"• Standard: 0 (ingen ændring)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 255
msgid "Crop the video's edges to keep only the part you need."
msgstr "Beskær videoens kanter for kun at beholde den del, du har brug for."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 276
msgid ""
"Select parts of the video to keep.\n"
"\n"
"Add sections with the + button or directly in the video using the markers button above the video.\n"
"\n"
"You can export selected parts as one file or as multiple clips\n"
" ideal for creating short videos for social media."
msgstr ""
"Vælg dele af videoen, som du vil beholde.\n"
"\n"
"Tilføj sektioner med + knappen eller direkte i videoen ved at bruge markørknappen ovenfor videoen.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan eksportere de valgte dele som én fil eller som flere klip, ideelt til at skabe korte videoer til sociale medier."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 282
msgid ""
"Run decode on the CPU and encode on the GPU.\n"
"\n"
"Usually best left disabled, but can help with certain compatibility issues."
msgstr ""
"Kør dekodning på CPU'en og kodning på GPU'en.\n"
"\n"
"Normalt bedst at lade være deaktiveret, men kan hjælpe med visse kompatibilitetsproblemer."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 286
msgid ""
"Audio quality:\n"
"\n"
"• Higher = better quality, larger file\n"
"• 128k: Good for most content\n"
"• 192k: High quality\n"
"• 256k+: Professional use\n"
"• Default: Auto (encoder decides)"
msgstr ""
"Lydkvalitet:\n"
"\n"
"• Højere = bedre kvalitet, større fil\n"
"• 128k: God til det meste indhold\n"
"• 192k: Høj kvalitet\n"
"• 256k+: Professionelt brug\n"
"• Standard: Auto (encoder beslutter)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 294
msgid ""
"Number of audio channels:\n"
"\n"
"• 1: Mono (single speaker)\n"
"• 2: Stereo (left/right)\n"
"• 6: 5.1 Surround\n"
"• 8: 7.1 Surround\n"
"• Default: Keep original"
msgstr ""
"Antal lydkanaler:\n"
"\n"
"• 1: Mono (enkelt højttaler)\n"
"• 2: Stereo (venstre/højre)\n"
"• 6: 5.1 Surround\n"
"• 8: 7.1 Surround\n"
"• Standard: Behold original"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 302
msgid ""
"Advanced: Custom FFmpeg options.\n"
"\n"
"• For experienced users only\n"
"• Invalid options may cause errors\n"
"• Example: -ss 60 -t 30 (skip 60s, take 30s)"
msgstr ""
"Avanceret: Tilpassede FFmpeg-indstillinger.\n"
"\n"
"• Kun for erfarne brugere\n"
"• Ugyldige indstillinger kan forårsage fejl\n"
"• Eksempel: -ss 60 -t 30 (spring 60s over, tag 30s)"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 273
msgid "Skips all remaining processes and just exports the embedded subtitles as an SRT file."
msgstr "Springer alle resterende processer over og eksporterer blot de indlejrede undertekster som en SRT-fil."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 318
msgid "You’re seeing an example of help shown when hovering over an item."
msgstr "Du ser et eksempel på hjælp, der vises, når du holder musen over et element."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 321
msgid ""
"Reduces background noise from audio using the GTCRN neural network.\n"
"\n"
"• Requires audio re-encoding\n"
"• Works best for constant background noise\n"
"• Automatically re-encodes audio if set to copy"
msgstr ""
"Reducer baggrundsstøj fra lyd ved hjælp af GTCRN-neuralt netværk.\n"
"\n"
"• Kræver lydgenkodning\n"
"• Fungerer bedst med konstant baggrundsstøj\n"
"• Genkoder automatisk lyd, hvis indstillet til at kopiere"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 327
msgid ""
"Adjust the intensity of noise reduction\n"
"\n"
"• 1.0: Maximum reduction (default)\n"
"• 0.5: Moderate reduction\n"
"• Lower values preserve more original audio"
msgstr ""
"Juster intensiteten af støjreduktion\n"
"\n"
"• 1.0: Maksimal reduktion (standard)\n"
"• 0.5: Moderat reduktion\n"
"• Lavere værdier bevarer mere original lyd"

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 333
msgid ""
"Noise gate silences audio below a volume threshold\n"
"\n"
"Useful combined with noise reduction to eliminate\n"
"residual noise during pauses between speech.\n"
"\n"
"Adjust intensity from low to maximum."
msgstr ""
"Støjdæmperen stilner lyd under en volumengrænse\n"
"\n"
"Nyttig i kombination med støjreduktion for at eliminere\n"
"resterende støj under pauser mellem tale.\n"
"\n"
"Juster intensiteten fra lav til maksimum."

# File: big-video-converter/big-video-converter/usr/share/big-video-
# converter/constants.py, line: 339
msgid ""
"Voice Recovery — high-frequency reconstruction\n"
"\n"
"Recovers frequencies above 8 kHz that the AI\n"
"noise reduction model removes.\n"
"\n"
"• 0%: Cuts all HF (maximum NR)\n"
"• 75%: Natural default\n"
"• 100%: Full original HF preserved"
msgstr ""
"Stemmegendannelse — højfrekvent rekonstruktion\n"
